  "releaseNotes": "## v2.2.1 (patch)\n\nChanges since v2.2.0:\n\n- [patch] Report a null key in OrderedMap.AddRange with ParamName \"pairs\" (#156) (matt-edmondson)\n- Test ExceptWith with a lazy view over the same set [patch] (#157) (matt-edmondson)\n- Leave an OrderedCollection unchanged when its comparer throws during AddRange [patch] (#160) (matt-edmondson)\n- Leave a set unchanged when its comparer throws during IntersectWith, ExceptWith or SymmetricExceptWith [patch] (#163) (matt-edmondson)\n- Report a null pair key in ContiguousMap and InsertionOrderMap as \"item\" or \"dictionary\" [patch] (#165) (matt-edmondson)",
